{
  "title": "Vedic Gayatri Mantra",
  "titleBengali": "বৈদিক গায়ত্রী মন্ত্র",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; color: rgb(251, 140, 0); font-weight: bold;\">বৈদিক গায়ত্রী মন্ত্র</span></div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 19px;\">ওঁ ভূর্ভুবঃ স্বঃ,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 19px;\">তৎ সবিতুর বরেণ্যম্,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 19px;\">ভর্গো দেবস্য ধীমহি,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 19px;\">ধিয়ো যো নঃ প্রচোদয়াৎ</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">।।</span></span></span></span><br></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">ॐ</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">भूर्</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nHI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">भुवः</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">स्वः</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nHI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">।</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">तत्सवितुर्वरेण्यं</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">भर्गो</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">देवस्य</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nHI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">धीमहि</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">।</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">धीयो</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">यो</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nHI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\nmso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">नः</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Mangal&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">प्रचोदयात्</span></span></span></span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;mso-bidi-language:\nHI\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">।</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">Om\nBhur Bhuvah Svah,</span></span></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">Tat\nSavitur Varenyam,</span></span></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">Bhargo\nDevasya Dheemahi, </span></span></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">Dhiyo\nYo Nah Prachodayat.</span></span></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(251, 140, 0);\">ভাবানুবাদ</span>:\nহে পরম ব্রহ্ম। আমি সকল প্রাণের উৎস&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-size: 19px;\">পরম&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;;\">সৃষ্টিকর্তার অংশ সূর্যের (অগ্নির) সেই আধ্যাত্মিক\nপবিত্র শক্তিকে স্মরণ করি। আমি সেই পাপনাশক আরাধ্য শক্তির ধ্যান প্রার্থনা করি, যেন তিনি\nআমার অন্তরে আধ্যাত্মিক বুদ্ধি জাগ্রত করেন। তিনি আমাকে সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করার জন্য\nআমার চেতনা ও চিন্তাধারাকে আলোকিত করে তোলেন।</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">\n\n</span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;****</span></span></span></span></p></div>"
}